{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Step inside the free demo today!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/6b95f089784589b7229d811d3c2e32e7.poster.avif?t=1767047898\" width=798 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/6b95f089784589b7229d811d3c2e32e7.webm?t=1767047898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/6b95f089784589b7229d811d3c2e32e7.mp4?t=1767047898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Demo runtime: 30-60 mins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/d6577e2b0c64a6f5049681650d4fa720.avif?t=1767047898\" width=1042 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her powers aren't all that useful for fighting, but they're fun! Use the <strong>boost</strong> ability to propel yourself, and the\u00a0<strong>bubble-gun</strong> ability to trap things in bubbles. Mastering these is the key to traversing and exploring the landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/d5a54ff80a5d3152dcb92f656ada6aea.poster.avif?t=1767047898\" width=970 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/d5a54ff80a5d3152dcb92f656ada6aea.webm?t=1767047898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/d5a54ff80a5d3152dcb92f656ada6aea.mp4?t=1767047898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/1d9f76d281eb132cc793e353f275c1ec.avif?t=1767047898\" width=1042 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This story follows a girl named Valerie who was able to attain magical powers, causing her mother to take her to <strong>The Unbound Society.</strong>\u00a0Her hope is that with their help, Valerie will make good use of her amazing talents. It plays out from two perspectives: her early childhood and later years, exploring the beginnings and aftermath of this decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluid platforming with bubbles, bouncing, boosting and slopes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cast of unique characters to meet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy, light-hearted sprinkle of humour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artwork, soundtrack and story created by the developer, Jole</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret collectibles to find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of cats (sometimes)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/8d93853febb032829c66f4f13c58ead1.poster.avif?t=1767047898\" width=584 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/8d93853febb032829c66f4f13c58ead1.webm?t=1767047898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"